    "meta.title": "Ditto MOMENTS | Little wonders in everyday life — Mugio", "meta.description": "Explore the city, photograph curious Momentlings and restore a shared diary. Ditto MOMENTS is a cozy narrative adventure about everyday life, by Mugio.",
